lyrics:
Christ The Lord Is Risen Today
Easter Hymn, 281; Llanfair, 271;

1.Kristu wamuka nhasi,
 
Hareruya!
  
Vanhu nengirozi vati:
  
Hareruya!
  
Simudzirai kutenda,
  
Hareruya!
  
Imbai denga nenyika:
 
Hareruya!

2.Basa rerudo rapera;
  
Kwarwiwa zino kwakundwa;
  
Rima rino paradzwa,
  
Zuva rino vheneka.

3.Vakamupfigira, asi
  
Kristu wakunda satani;
  
Haakundwe nokufa;
  
Denga dzvene, wazarura.

4.Jesu ndiye mupenyu;
  
Rufu, uripiko zvino?
 
Wakafa kutiponisa;
  
Guva rakakundwa naye.

Toenda kuna Kristu,
  
Totevera Tenzi wedu;
  
Saiye, tichamuka;
  
M’chinjikwa, guva, denga

Charles Wesley (1707-88)

My Jesus I Love Thee

Unsworth, 577; Flow gently, Sweet Afton, 558

1.Jesu ndinokudai, muri ‘ye wangu,

Ndinosiya zvose nokuda kwenyu;

Muri Mununuri, Mponisi wangu,

Ndinokudai Jesu, ndokuda zvino.

2.Ndinokudai nokuti makandida,

Matenga rudzikinuro paK’vhari;

Ndinokudai makapfekedzwa minzwa.

Ndinokudai Jesu, ndokudai zvino.

3.Ndinokudai muupenyu, nomurufu;

Ndokurumbidzai nokusingaperi;

Nomusi wokufa ndichazoimba;

Ndinokudai Jesu, ndokudai zvino.

4.Mazambara orufaro ikoko,

Ndichazonamata pasuo hwenyu;

Ndichazoimba nengundu pamhanza;

Ndinokudai Jesu, ndokudai zvino.

William Ralph Featherstone
(1846-73)

The Church’s One Foundation

Aurelia, 246

1.Hwaro hwechichi humwe,

Jesu ndiye Tenzi;

Chisikwa chake chitsva

Nemvura neizwi;

Mwenga wake mutsvene

Wepasi pedenga;

Neropa waitenga,

Nokuifirazve.

2.Vasarudzwi vepasi

Vose vamwechete;

Chitendero chaIshe;

Rutendo, kuzvarwa;

Vokudza zita rimwe

Nechidyo chitsvene;

Tariro imwechete,

Yozadzwa nengoni.

3.Nomumatambudziko,

Nebishi rehondo;

Vomirira magumo

Okusingaperi;

Dakara netariro

Vazokomborerwa;

Nechechi ichikunda;

Nokuzozorodzwa.

4.Pasi pano vaziva

Utatu hwaMwari;

Vosanganiswa vose

Navo vakakunda;

Vatsvene vanofara,

Ishe, tipei ngoni,

Saivo, tizogara

Navo pakudenga

S.J. Stone (1839-1900)

Whosoever Will May Come,

Whosoever will may come, 8609

1.Ngavatore ruponiso

Vanoda kugara naShe;

Nokuti runovimbiswa

Kupiwa kumunhu wose.

Munhu wose ngaauye;

Anouya ngaazive

Kuti haachatsamwa,

Jesu wati: munhu wose.

2.Izwi iri rinosvika,

Kundudzi dzevanhu vose;

Hapana nokusarudzwa;

Jesu wati: munhu wose.

3.Kuna vanotya mumwoyo,

Tariro haishaikwe;

Ngavauye vasingatye,

Jesu wati: munhu wose.

4.Kuvanhu vose venyika,

Matama aya agere;

Anoti munzeve dzavo;

Angauye munhu wose.

William John McAlonanan

Have Thine Own Way, Lord,

Have Thine own way, Lord, 837

1.Chiitai, Ishe kuda kwenyu;

Ndimi muumbi, ndiri m’nyakwe;

Ndiumbei sokuda kwenyu, ‘She,

Ndakamirira, ndozvipira.

2.Chiitai, Ishe kuda kwenyu;

Nditarisei Ishe, nhasi;

Ngandicheniswe sechando, ‘She,

Pamberi penyu ndokotama.

3.Chiitai, Ishe kuda kwenyu;

Ndibatsireiwo ndakaneta;

Nesimba rose nderenyu ‘She,

Ndibatei mundiponise, ‘She.

4.Chiitai, Ishe kuda kwenyu;

Upenyu hwangu tungamirai;

Ndizadze mweya kuti vose,

Vaone Kristu nemandiri

